# A leave without immediate leave, two set-top boxes behind port 1. One leaves;
# igmpd sends no group-specific query, but the OLT does, the row is still
# programmed so the query reaches the other box, and its report at 11 restores
# the full interval: the row stays after the 2 s last-member time is up. At 100
# the other box leaves too and nothing answers, so the row goes at 102.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
10 v2leave 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
11 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.11 239.1.1.1
12 tick
13 tick
14 state
100 v2leave 1 0 192.168.1.11 239.1.1.1
101 tick
102 tick
103 state
